fail "apis object crossing a channel and an actor without Sends", "`+ch` is given to a task: `*Chan[^{Shape + Owned}]` holds `{Shape + Owned}`, an API object whose braces and API name no `Sends` or `Syncs` for this, so what it hides may go to no task", "an actor runs its methods on a task of its own, and `<b` is given to it: `^{Shape + Owned}` hides its value's type without naming `Sends`: write `^{Shape + Owned + Sends}`", errors: 2
